ntory with a medical device. While Rene finds his furniture locker enlightening and Ivy finds some unexpected green.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fzm5wgvcqKJPr8AeV4HkY9awXke.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-19\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"The Nutty Appraiser\",\"overview\":\"Adelanto is the site of the Dotsons’ return; Dave tries to get his motors runnin’; Darrell stumbles over a curious collection; Rene finally goes nuts.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5L58ptMDvWJDbUqUu3bfJBzttH1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-19\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Who Wants to Be a Mil-li-NER?\",\"overview\":\"Costa Mesa offers Rene a bit of unexpected \\\"high\\\" tech. Meanwhile Darrell goes on a cross cultural haberdashery and Kenny kick starts his career with some \\\"hot\\\" pockets.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ox4fNmG9eLJCbVtNZggil3qY09h.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-26\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"I Learned it From Watching You!\",\"overview\":\"The team stop in Huntington Beach where Rene’s daughter steps up; the Schulzes and Passantes add to their outdoor options; and the Gambler meets the predators.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8QOzR2ahZLMk2lnYJhqJ59J9OTR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-04-26\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"Quoth the Kenny: Kumbaya!\",\"overview\":\"Darrell's pupil has a gothic graduation; Kenny goes \\\"low key undercover,\\\" uncovering a new career opportunity.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wMGI4LKzWY4kyvDFMACDWYbg3DM.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-03\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Pop, Lock & Auction\",\"overview\":\"Ivy takes a chance on his own party locker; Brandi & Jarrod get back to basics; Rene gets advice on his presentation.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iQ0Vb42iaiHwO0IctEpk47QzHNq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-03\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Happiness Is a Warm Laser Gun\",\"overview\":\"Mary finally manages to find a vintage goodie in El Monte; Ivy uncovers decades-old family fun; while Darrell re-visits a childhood pastime.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hCOxf718PkzRKoFz2kPJVOdywhR.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"voteCount\":1,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-10\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"That's the Way the Terra Cotta Crumbles\",\"overview\":\"Kenny finds some relief in a unit; Brandi & Mary join forces; Dave stumbles across an historic find.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iRfXMiEucLcX8GpU8ni1gDLel1b.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-10\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Granny Get Your Gun\",\"overview\":\"Ivy can't get enough from Montebello; Dave gets a taste of carnival fun; Brandi & Jarrod shred vintage-style.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q8wpXRxJSqmnj6KyCesuzcc6BYK.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-17\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Olé/GYN\",\"overview\":\"Mary's locker brings out her inner voice; Kenny tries to clothe America; Brandi & Jarrod get a leg up on the competition.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nIgDqpEAQKXo6dIKu2kMF2pxJLD.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-17\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"You Win Some, You Luge Some\",\"overview\":\"Indio is extreme-ly interesting for Dave, Brandi and Jarrod find the ultimate stash, and Mary's locker misfires.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gaX0NHiXDxCSkbKDacoEvFOXELq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-05-24\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Value of the Dolls\",\"overview\":\"Jarrod finds the Party Locker he's always wanted; Rene discovers a new mobile business opportunity; Ivy's footwear makes a huge impact.\",\"still\":\"https: