.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9R04qzWWJCtiG7xaerrjQFn2iNB.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-06-14\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":21,\"name\":\"Vamos a Placentia\",\"overview\":\"Rene laughs all the way to the bank and Darrell reels in a hoard of goodies\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/ndQefXXOSWNz1xfG0qr4xuu5Kli.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-12\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":22,\"name\":\"Mutt-erial Girl\",\"overview\":\"In Riverside, Brandi saves a loose pooch from oncoming traffic; Darrell’s locker confirms his Magic Bullet Theory; while Kenny’s unit serves up a shiny score.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A362DBH0Gv1DhMrvMbdR89HvQDY.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-19\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":23,\"name\":\"Me, Myself and Ivy\",\"overview\":\"The buyers head to Arcadia, where Darrell gives AND takes, Ivy’s prospects soar, and Rene and Casey find a his & hers locker.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7so87uzymM3SxHnTQO7yrwnoJDq.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-07-26\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":24,\"name\":\"666: The Sign of the Profit\",\"overview\":\"A visit to San Bernardino jepoardizes Mary’s fortune while Ivy manages to scrap together a bit of coin and Kenny finds all the magic.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iEaibRDB9IhDfzZzXhKTiyBm6br.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-02\",\"runtime\":25},{\"number\":25,\"name\":\"Tour de Chance\",\"overview\":\"The girls have a newlywed-themed surprise for Emily; Rene reels in a huge locker; and Darrell tests his bicycle knowledge and wins\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aIRcSYXRMzJsyOyDASTu7jF5wXN.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2017-08-02\",\"runtime\":25}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2010-12-01\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}